      "shortDescription": "EMZ supplies electric motors and complete drive-system components for industrial applications, from low-voltage motors to high-voltage and special machines. Its documented range also includes geared motors, transformers, frequency converters and motor-starting equipment.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "Official company sources identify EMZ Elektromaschinenzentrale GmbH as a German electric-drive specialist founded in 1952 and headquartered in Recklinghausen.",
        "EMZ supplies and configures low- and high-voltage motors, geared motors, transformers, frequency converters, resistance starters, soft starters and coordinated drive systems for demanding industrial machinery. The published high-voltage range includes compact, modular, synchronous and special motor configurations for applications such as pumps, paper and wood processing, steel and recycling, cement, chemical operations and power generation."
